<title>UK: SBC unit sets 100 million stg bond due 2000.</title>
<headline>SBC unit sets 100 million stg bond due 2000.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SBC JERSEY</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    25.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0125  PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.825    SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND GILT DUE AUGUST 1999</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF DEBT SECURITIES PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
